GrandDad: {
	TooltipNormal:
		'''
		An unfathomably heavy blade that rips through enemies using its sheer mass
		Heals you on hit
		Striking weaker enemies will launch them with incredible force
		Launched enemies take immense damage when colliding with walls and floors
		Holding <right> while swinging will heavily reduce the damage of the blade and increase its launch damage and velocity
		[c/00B8DF:'How are you swinging something that has half the mass of a star?']
		'''
	TooltipGFB:
		'''
		A high quality blade that rips through enemies
		Striking weaker enemies will yeet them with incredible force, often leaving them Stuck Inside tiles
		Yeeted enemies will turn to JAM when SLAMMED into walls and floors
		Holding <right> while swinging will heavily reduce the damage of the blade and increase its yeet damage and velocity, nice >:]
		[c/00B8DF:'Please read the weapon description.']
		'''
}

